     The QQ__QQAADDDDQQ(), QQ__QQDDIIVVQQ(), QQ__QQMMUULLQQ(), QQ__QQSSUUBBQQ() QQ__NNOORRMMPPRREECC(), QQ__QQCCLLOONNEEQQ()
     and QQ__QQCCPPYYVVAALLQQ() functions return 0 on success, or an errno on failure.
     EINVAL is returned for divide-by-zero.  EOVERFLOW and ERANGE are returned
